---
layout: base.njk
title: "About"
description: "Paul Raff — who goes by Raff — has over 15 years of experience in data science and applied research, on top of his PhD education."
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Impact, across domains</h1>
    <p class="lead">Paul Raff — who goes by Raff — has over 15 years of experience in data science and applied research on top of his PhD education. Here's a summary of the impact he has delivered across multiple domains.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:1rem">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="timeline">
      {% for job in site.timeline %}
        <div class="tl-item">
          <span class="tl-logo"><img src="/assets/img/logos/{{ job.logo }}.png" alt="{{ job.org }} logo"></span>
          <p class="tl-org">{{ job.org }}</p>
          {% for role in job.roles %}
            <p class="tl-role">{{ role }}</p>
          {% endfor %}
          <p class="tl-body">{{ job.body }}</p>
          {% if job.links.length %}
            <p class="tl-links">
              {% for l in job.links %}<a href="{{ l.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ l.label }}&nbsp;↗</a>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}
            </p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-card">
      <h2>Interested in working together?</h2>
      <p>Whether it's experimentation, analytics, or data infrastructure — I'd love to hear what you're working on.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Get in Touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
